%-*-Erlang-*-
%% The Diameter codec modules (diameter_*.erl in src/, diameter_*.hrl in
%% include/) are checked into the repo as the source of truth and compile as
%% ordinary source. The third-party rebar3_diameter_compiler plugin has been
%% removed: it does not load on OTP 29 (its clean_diameter.erl uses a bare
%% `catch`, now a hard error).
%%
%% Regeneration uses OTP's own diameter_make:codec/2 (the org convention),
%% run manually against dia/. NOTE: 3 of the 16 codecs (diameter_rfc4005_nasreq,
%% diameter_3gpp_ts29_229, diameter_3gpp_ts29_061_sgi_base_acc) have no .dia in
%% dia/ — they were copied from the smf project — so a regenerate-on-build hook
%% is deferred until those .dia sources are reconciled (roadmap W3 follow-up).
{erl_opts, [debug_info]}.
